<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 171.09 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 171.09 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 171.09 million rand's worth of South Africa bonds on Tuesday after buying 227.24 million rand's worth on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
